    "detailed_description": "This is a game that took 7 years to create and was created by two developers.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cI must find my sister, after all I don\u2019t want to be alone.\u201d Inspired by Japan\u2019s famous stealth action game and the remarkable game phenomenon, Only Up, Paradox Metal takes place in a futuristic world where there are vicious robots at every corner and Kagura\u2019s goal is to find her way past all of them and reunite with her sister, Setsuna! <br />\r\nYou will use stealth, weapons and a controlled missile launcher to get your way through each level filled with robots and cameras. Don\u2019t be slow but don\u2019t be hasty either because once the robots discover your whereabouts and attack the game will reset back to Level 1, and all of your progress will be lost. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nControls to for movement and sneaking by: <br />\r\n<br />\r\nPC: W - move forward or climb<br />\r\n        A - move left <br />\r\n        S - move back/retreat<br />\r\n        D - move right <br />\r\n        F - First Person viewpoint <br />\r\nOther Controls : Arrow keys <br />\r\n<br />\r\nAccess Your Stash: <br />\r\n          Hold 1: Display item menu<br />\r\n          Press 1 and D together: Switch items<br />\r\n          Hold 2: Display weapons menu<br />\r\n          Press 2 and D together: Switch and Equip weapons <br />\r\n<br />\r\nAttack Like Your Life Depends on It: <br />\r\n          Left Click: Punch if no weapon equipped<br />\r\n          Left Click: Shoot if gun is equipped <br />\r\n          Spacebar: Squeeze Enemies to death <br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOh! And remember you can\u2019t save the game. Good luck!",
    "about_the_game": "This is a game that took 7 years to create and was created by two developers.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cI must find my sister, after all I don\u2019t want to be alone.\u201d Inspired by Japan\u2019s famous stealth action game and the remarkable game phenomenon, Only Up, Paradox Metal takes place in a futuristic world where there are vicious robots at every corner and Kagura\u2019s goal is to find her way past all of them and reunite with her sister, Setsuna! <br />\r\nYou will use stealth, weapons and a controlled missile launcher to get your way through each level filled with robots and cameras. Don\u2019t be slow but don\u2019t be hasty either because once the robots discover your whereabouts and attack the game will reset back to Level 1, and all of your progress will be lost. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nControls to for movement and sneaking by: <br />\r\n<br />\r\nPC: W - move forward or climb<br />\r\n        A - move left <br />\r\n        S - move back/retreat<br />\r\n        D - move right <br />\r\n        F - First Person viewpoint <br />\r\nOther Controls : Arrow keys <br />\r\n<br />\r\nAccess Your Stash: <br />\r\n          Hold 1: Display item menu<br />\r\n          Press 1 and D together: Switch items<br />\r\n          Hold 2: Display weapons menu<br />\r\n          Press 2 and D together: Switch and Equip weapons <br />\r\n<br />\r\nAttack Like Your Life Depends on It: <br />\r\n          Left Click: Punch if no weapon equipped<br />\r\n          Left Click: Shoot if gun is equipped <br />\r\n          Spacebar: Squeeze Enemies to death <br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOh! And remember you can\u2019t save the game. Good luck!",
